  <h2>How to check if a real estate builder in Lucknow is legitimate</h2>

  <p>There are four things you should verify before signing any contract with a real estate builder in Lucknow. First, check their GSTIN on the GST portal. Second, verify their MSME Udyam registration number on the Udyam portal. Third, ask for their ISO certificate and cross-check the certifying body. Fourth, ask for at least two client references with phone numbers you can call independently.</p>

  <p>VP Infra's details for your reference: MSME registration number UDYAM-UP-50-0085926, ISO 9001:2015 certified, registered address at M-652, Sector-M, Ashiyana Colony, Kanpur Road, Lucknow 226012. Every one of these can be independently verified. That's intentional.</p>

  <p>Beyond documents, visit an active construction site managed by the builder you're considering. A clean, organised site with safety netting, labelled material storage, and a visible site supervisor tells you more about the company's management quality than any certificate will.</p>

